[h1]Double Jump[/h1]A lightweight client-side Fabric mod that adds configurable multiple jumping.
[h2]Features[/h2][list]
[*]Enable or disable the mod[/*]
[*]Set the total jump count from 2 to 10 with a slider[/*]
[*]Enter a custom jump count above 10[/*]
[*]Enable unlimited airborne jumps[/*]
[*]Configure through a vanilla-style settings screen[/*]
[*]Optional Mod Menu integration[/*]
[/list][h2]Usage[/h2]Press the normal jump key again while airborne to perform another jump. Landing resets the available jump count.
Because this mod is client-side only, remote servers may correct or reject modified movement.
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.1.2[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.2+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.150.0+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
